    "en": "Where is the car?"
   },
   "source": "3lang-original",
   "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
   "needsReview": false
  },
  {
   "id": "es.a0.sent.a09",
   "text": "Me gusta el chocolate.",
   "translations": {
    "ar": "أنا بحب الشوكولاتة.",
    "en": "I like chocolate."
   },
   "source": "3lang-original",
   "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
   "needsReview": false
  },
  {
   "id": "es.a0.sent.a41",
   "text": "¿Dónde está el teléfono?",
